<title>INDONESIA: Bank Umum 1996 net up to 66.73 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Bank Umum 1996 net up to 66.73 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		(in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     66.73 vs 53.25</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)		 269  vs 339</p>
<p>    Net interest income			 222.64 vs 203.73</p>
<p>    Other operating income		     77.73 vs  53.68</p>
<p>    Other operating expense		   203.65 vs 186.28</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     96.71 vs  71.13</p>
<p>    Retained earnings			   195.05 vs 144.92</p>
<p>NOTE: PT Bank Umum Nasional is among Indonesia's large privately-owned banks.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
